{"begin":"BEGIN_FSV-B13_autopac_generate_MAIN","stage":"autopac_generate","output":{"status":"READY","rego":"package external_pilot

import rego.v1

default allow := false

# Role Allowed to Over Deliver/Receive: users with this role may exceed the allowance percentage.
allow if {
    input.trusted.authorizedRole
}

# Otherwise, the receipt quantity must not exceed the derived maximum (limit-percent inclusive).
allow if {
    input.request.body.qty <= input.trusted.derivedMaximumQty
}
","reason":"Stock Settings documents a Limit Percent for over-delivery/receipt and a 'Role Allowed to Over Deliver/Receive' exception. The adapter supplies trusted.derivedMaximumQty (the computed allowance ceiling) and trusted.authorizedRole (whether the caller holds the over-deliver/receive role). The policy permits the request when the authorized role is present, or when the requested qty is within the derived maximum. No unrelated validation is added."},"end":"END_FSV-B13_autopac_generate_MAIN"}
